1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,609
Pollination is the transfer of pollen from an anther to a stigma.

2
00:00:04,609 --> 00:00:10,833
It has to happen before fertilization, because flowering plant sperm cannot swim.

3
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:16,575
They can only reach the egg through a pollen tube grown from a grain that has landed on a stigma.

